  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Equation of the curves <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now for parabola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, equation of tangent is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Which is also&nbsp;tangent to parabola&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math>,</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;will satisfy the curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math>,</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>mx</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>64</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now making discriminant zero we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>64</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, the equation of tangent is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now distance of point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from the tangent will be,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>9</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
